osition:absolute; right:calc(5px + 9.0909%); display:inline-block;\">100%</div></div></div>\n</div><div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n</div>\n<div id=\"w-creature-location\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Location\">Location</span></h3>\n<p><a href=\"#/wiki/Mount%20Sternum%2FUndead%20Cave\">Mount Sternum Undead Cave</a>, <a href=\"#/wiki/Dwarf%20Mines\">Dwarf Mines</a>, Circle Room in <a href=\"#/wiki/Kazordoon\">Kazordoon</a>, <a href=\"#/wiki/Triangle%20Tower\">Triangle Tower</a>, <a href=\"#/wiki/Tiquanda%2FDwarf%20Cave\">Tiquanda Dwarf Cave</a>, <a href=\"#/wiki/Cormaya%20Dwarf%20Cave\">Cormaya Dwarven Cave</a>, <a href=\"#/wiki/Beregar%20Mines\">Beregar Mines</a>.\n</p>\n</div>\n<div id=\"w-creature-behaviour\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Behaviour\">Behaviour</span></h3>\n<p>\tA dwarf geomancer attacks from a distance. A dwarf geomancer will retreat at 150  (39.47%, yellow) health.\n</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n<div class=\"history-section\" id=\"w-creature-history\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-History\">History</span></h3>\n<p>Although the sprites for dwarf geomancer were implemented on Update 7.0, the first spawns of this creature were only added to the game with Update 7.2.<br/>\nA long time ago, Dwarf Geomancers used to drop <a href=\"#/wiki/Boots%20of%20Haste\">Boots of Haste</a>, but as players became stronger and killed them more easily, Cip removed this rare drop.\n</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n<div>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Loot\">Loot</span></h3>\n<p><small><i>Drop rates are estimated based on 4,876 samples <span class=\"loot-stats-link\">(Loot Statistics)</span>.</i></small> <small><i>Colour-coding is applied after 500 samples.</i></small><br/><small><i>Task column indicates items used in delivery tasks.</i></small>\n</p>\n<table class=\"wikitable sortable\" style=\"text-align:center; width:auto;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<th></th>\n<th>Item</th>\n<th>Task</th>\n<th>Qua